1. DOWN TIME :THE APPLICATION  WILL NOT BE AVAILABE WHILE CHANGING HARDWARE
2. IP USSES  : IP OF SERVER WILL BE CHANGED
3. SERVICE   : SERVICES INSIDE SERVER WILL BE STOPPED

TRACKING POLICY: USED TO SCALE THE SERVERS
